      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Identical chord set, identical shapes, different starting point. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Same Notes, Different Home",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "minor-caged-what-decides-home"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s pair swapped a chord; this one swaps nothing at all. Every grip your hand plays is identical in both clips — only the order changes, and with it, which chord you rest on last."
        }
      ]
    },
